# package.json files is the primary allowlist; never depend on local Git ignores.
**/node_modules/
**/.paqvilo/
**/.pp-local/
**/.git/
**/obj/
**/bin/
!bin/paqvilo.mjs
**/out/
**/coverage/
**/*.log
**/.env
**/.env.local
**/paqvilo.config.local.yml
docs/assets/*
!docs/assets/overview.svg
!docs/assets/lense-icon.png
!docs/assets/mirage-icon.png
!docs/assets/lense-visual.png
!docs/assets/mirage-visual.png
